# Requires a physically populated NAND target and NAND pinmux, controller and
# device-tree support in the matching U-Boot. The current SDMMC design does
# not establish this. Reserve 4 KiB of DDR scratch at 0x85000000 first.
nand info
nand device
nand bad
nand read 0x85000000 0 0x1000
md.b 0x85000000 0x100
